<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Lumina Optics | Professional Camera Store</title>
  <style>
    /* CSS RESET & VARIABLES */
    :root {
      --bg-dark: #0f1115;
      --bg-card: #181b20;
      --bg-light: #22262e;
      --accent: #ff5252;
      --text-main: #f0f2f5;
      --text-muted: #9aa0a6;
      --border-color: #2e3440;
      --font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font-family);
      background-color: var(--bg-dark);
      color: var(--text-main);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    /* HEADER & NAVIGATION (MEGA MENU) */
    header {
      background-color: #0b0c0e;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 1000;
    }

    .nav-container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 20px 0;
    }

    .logo span {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .nav-item {
      position: relative;
    }

    .nav-item > a {
      display: block;
      padding: 25px 20px;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      transition: color 0.3s;
    }

    .nav-item:hover > a {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    /* MEGA MENU DROPDOWN HOVER EFFECT */
    .mega-menu {
      position: absolute;
      top: 100%;
      left: 0;
      width: 600px;
      background-color: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-top: 3px solid var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      padding: 25px;
      gap: 20px;
      opacity: 0;
      visibility: hidden;
      transform: translateY(10px);
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .nav-item:hover .mega-menu {
      opacity: 1;
      visibility: visible;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    .mega-column h4 {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .mega-column ul {
      list-style: none;
    }

    .mega-column li {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .mega-column a {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .mega-column a:hover {
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    /* HERO BANNER SECTION */
    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(rgba(15, 17, 21, 0.7), rgba(15, 17, 21, 0.9)), 
                  url('https://picsum.photos/id/250/1600/700') center/cover no-repeat;
      height: 70vh;
      min-height: 480px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .hero-content {
      max-width: 750px;
    }

    .hero-content h1 {
      font-size: 3.2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .hero-content p {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .btn-cta {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: var(--accent);
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1rem;
      transition: background-color 0.3s;
    }

    .btn-cta:hover {
      background-color: #e04343;
    }

    /* SECTION CONTAINERS */
    .section-container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 70px auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
    }

    .section-title::after {
      content: '';
      display: block;
      width: 50px;
      height: 3px;
      background-color: var(--accent);
      margin: 10px auto 0;
    }

    /* 3 PRODUCT CATEGORIES */
    .categories-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 25px;
    }

    .category-card {
      position: relative;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      height: 250px;
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
    }

    .category-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0,0,0,0.85));
    }

    .category-content {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 20px;
      left: 20px;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .category-content h3 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .category-content span {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* 4 FEATURED PRODUCTS */
    .products-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 25px;
    }

    .product-card {
      background-color: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      transition: transform 0.3s;
    }

    .product-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
    }

    .product-card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 180px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .product-title {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .product-price {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      color: var(--text-main);
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      cursor: pointer;
      width: 100%;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: all 0.3s;
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background-color: var(--accent);
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    /* PROMO BANNER */
    .promo-banner {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e2430 0%, #0f1115 100%);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-left: 5px solid var(--accent);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 40px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .promo-text h3 {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .promo-text p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    /* SEO SECTION */
    .seo-section {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
      align-items: center;
      background-color: var(--bg-card);
      padding: 40px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    }

    .seo-text h2 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .seo-text p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      text-align: justify;
    }

    .seo-image img {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 8px;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    /* FOOTER */
    footer {
      background-color: #0b0c0e;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      padding: 60px 0 20px;
      margin-top: 80px;
    }

    .footer-grid {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .footer-col h4 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .footer-col ul {
      list-style: none;
    }

    .footer-col li {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .footer-col a {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .footer-col a:hover {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .newsletter-form input {
      padding: 10px;
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 4px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      background-color: var(--bg-dark);
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .newsletter-form button {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 10px;
      background-color: var(--accent);
      border: none;
      color: #fff;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .social-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 15px;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }

    .social-links a {
      background-color: var(--bg-light);
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    .footer-bottom {
      text-align: center;
      padding-top: 40px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .seo-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero-content h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; }
      .mega-menu { width: 100%; position: static; display: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- 1. HEADER & MEGA MENU -->
  <header>
    <div class="nav-container">
      <div class="logo">LUMINA<span>.</span>OPTICS</div>
      <nav>
        <ul class="nav-links">
          <li class="nav-item">
            <a href="#">Cameras ▾</a>
            <!-- Mega Menu Dropdown -->
            <div class="mega-menu">
              <div class="mega-column">
                <h4>Mirrorless</h4>
                <ul>
                  <li><a href="#">Full-Frame Bodies</a></li>
                  <li><a href="#">APS-C Cameras</a></li>
                  <li><a href="#">Medium Format</a></li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="mega-column">
                <h4>Cinema</h4>
                <ul>
                  <li><a href="#">4K/8K Cinema Rigs</a></li>
                  <li><a href="#">Action & PTZ</a></li>
                  <li><a href="#">Production Video</a></li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="mega-column">
                <h4>Accessories</h4>
                <ul>
                  <li><a href="#">Battery Grips</a></li>
                  <li><a href="#">Memory Cards</a></li>
                  <li><a href="#">Camera Bags</a></li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="nav-item"><a href="#">Lenses</a></li>
          <li class="nav-item"><a href="#">Lighting</a></li>
          <li class="nav-item"><a href="#">Deals</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- 2. HERO BANNER -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1>Capture the Unseen World</h1>
      <p>Next-generation full-frame mirrorless cameras engineered for visionary creators and visual storytellers.</p>
      <a href="#featured" class="btn-cta">Explore Flagship Series</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3. 3 PRODUCT CATEGORIES -->
  <section class="section-container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Browse Categories</h2>
    <div class="categories-grid">
      <div class="category-card" style="background-image: url('https://picsum.photos/id/1059/600/400');">
        <div class="category-content">
          <h3>Mirrorless Systems</h3>
          <span>12 Models Available</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="category-card" style="background-image: url('https://picsum.photos/id/250/600/400');">
        <div class="category-content">
          <h3>Prime Lenses</h3>
          <span>24 Optics Available</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="category-card" style="background-image: url('https://picsum.photos/id/433/600/400');">
        <div class="category-content">
          <h3>Cinema & Video</h3>
          <span>8 Systems Available</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4. 4 FEATURED PRODUCTS -->
  <section class="section-container" id="featured">
    <h2 class="section-title">Featured Gear</h2>
    <div class="products-grid">
      <div class="product-card">
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/250/300/200" alt="Lumina X-Pro" />
        <h3 class="product-title">Lumina X-Pro 8K Body</h3>
        <p class="product-price">$2,499.00</p>
        <button class="btn-secondary">Add to Cart</button>
      </div>
      <div class="product-card">
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/433/300/200" alt="Apex Lens" />
        <h3 class="product-title">Apex 35mm f/1.2 Prime</h3>
        <p class="product-price">$1,199.00</p>
        <button class="btn-secondary">Add to Cart</button>
      </div>
      <div class="product-card">
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1059/300/200" alt="Cine Vision" />
        <h3 class="product-title">CineVision 4K Rig</h3>
        <p class="product-price">$3,850.00</p>
        <button class="btn-secondary">Add to Cart</button>
      </div>
      <div class="product-card">
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/364/300/200" alt="Carbon Tripod" />
        <h3 class="product-title">ProGrip Carbon Tripod</h3>
        <p class="product-price">$349.00</p>
        <button class="btn-secondary">Add to Cart</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 5. PROMO BANNER SECTION -->
  <section class="section-container">
    <div class="promo-banner">
      <div class="promo-text">
        <h3>Summer Creator Bundle Sale</h3>
        <p>Save up to 30% on select lens kits and receive a free Pelican hard case with purchase.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="#" class="btn-cta">Claim Bundle Offer</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 6. SEO SECTION (EXACTLY 175 WORDS) -->
  <section class="section-container">
    <div class="seo-section">
      <div class="seo-text">
        <h2>Elevate Your Photography with Premium Gear</h2>
        <p>
          Welcome to Lumina Optics, your ultimate destination for professional-grade photographic equipment and cinematic tools. Whether you are an aspiring visual artist capturing raw street portraits, a seasoned documentary filmmaker navigating harsh environments, or a commercial landscape photographer seeking unmatched dynamic range, our curated selection of high-performance mirrorless camera bodies, ultra-sharp prime lenses, and rugged stabilization gear is built to empower your vision. We collaborate directly with industry-leading manufacturers to bring you state-of-the-art full-frame sensors, hyper-fast autofocus systems, and cutting-edge optical glass engineered for exceptional color fidelity. Photography is more than just taking pictures—it is the art of freezing time, telling powerful stories, and expressing unique perspectives. Beyond providing top-tier imaging equipment, our team of dedicated optics specialists offers detailed buyers' guides, expert advice, comprehensive warranty coverage, and reliable post-purchase support to ensure every shutter click exceeds your expectations. Explore our latest arrivals today, discover competitive trade-in offers, and upgrade your creative toolkit with equipment engineered for uncompromising clarity, speed, and durability under any shooting conditions. Start your journey with premium imagery precision engineered for perfection.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="seo-image">
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/250/600/400" alt="Professional Camera Sensor" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 7. FOOTER WITH NEWSLETTER & SOCIAL MEDIA -->
  <footer>
    <div class="footer-grid">
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Lumina Optics</h4>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">Empowering visual storytellers with industry-defining camera equipment and precision optics worldwide.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Quick Links</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="#">About Us</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">Shipping & Returns</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">Warranty Info</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">Trade-In Program</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Follow Us</h4>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">Connect on social channels:</p>
        <div class="social-links">
          <a href="#">Instagram</a>
          <a href="#">YouTube</a>
          <a href="#">Twitter</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Subscribe to Newsletter</h4>
        <div class="newsletter-form">
          <input type="email" placeholder="Enter your email address" required />
          <button type="button">Subscribe</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom">
      &copy; 2026 Lumina Optics Inc. All rights reserved. Designed for clean developer integration.
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
